        "text": "Staff engagement survey",
        "level": 1,
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d5060000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "This survey asks how you feel about working here. It is anonymous: please do not write your name anywhere on it. We only ever report results for groups of at least five people, so no one's answers can be picked out, and the questions about you at the end are optional.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d5060000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "For each statement, choose the answer closest to how you feel. There are no right or wrong answers, and honest answers help us most. We will share the overall results with everyone and tell you what we plan to do about them.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
